Thumbs.db

# The add-on's build context can only see files inside addon/, so a wheel built
# from this checkout is handed to it through addon/dist/. The wheel itself is a
# build artifact and stays out of git; the directory has to exist in a fresh
# clone or the Dockerfile's `COPY dist/` fails, hence the .keep.
!addon/dist/
addon/dist/*
!addon/dist/.keep
